          "control_power_limit_kw": "Commissioned power ceiling for writes (kW/kVA; 0 disables power writes)",
          "service_controls": "Enable service setting writes",
          "ems_controls": "Allow expert EMS mode selection"
        },
        "description": "Power writes require a commissioned installation ceiling. Service writes default to disabled. Selecting EMS does not implement an external EMS or meter/BMS emulation; these require a separate continuous controller. Disable a schedule period before editing its times."
